'''Snowfall''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The top of the blade mostly resembles a starry night, as it is made to resemble the night sky while it's snowing. Then, the bottom part of the blade and the handle is white, which resembles snow, hence the name.
